">획 데이터: Make Me a Hanzi (Arphic Public License)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E5E1D8;border-top:3px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#F5F3EE\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:4px\">오늘의 한 문장</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:14px\">오늘 배운 글자가 진짜 기사 제목에 이렇게 나왔습니다</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.6;color:#0D1725;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;word-break:keep-all;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">请</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">以</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">下</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">几</span>位<span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">同</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">学</span><span style=\"color:#8C6423;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #A8792B\">来</span>领书</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:6px\">qǐng yǐxià jǐ wèi tóngxué lái lǐng shū</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">다음 몇 분의 학우는 책을 받으러 오세요.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #A8792B;font-size:15px;color:#24272E;line-height:1.7;word-break:keep-all\">오늘 배운 同学가 请 뒤에 놓여, 누구에게 부탁하는지를 가리키고 있습니다.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">同学</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">tóngxué</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">학우, 반 친구</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">请</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">qǐng</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">~해 주세요</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">以下</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">yǐxià</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">다음, 아래</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">几</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">jǐ</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">몇</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7\"><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0D1725\">来</span><span style=\"flex:0 0 auto;color:#767469\">lái</span><span style=\"color:#24272E;word-break:keep-all\">오다</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:8px 0\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#767469;margin-bottom:4px\">이 문장 듣기</div>\n<p><audio controls preload=\"none\" src=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day45-news.mp3\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:420px\"><a href=\"https://daytip.kr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/day45-news.mp3\">소리 내려받기</a></audio></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:#767469\">출처 <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE4zcWpFSVNYQm9Tc3hoSDVub1BINjdWYVU4UndFWVlyVXNvNDNxVXpSdFo2QnZONW9jY1dnbEhoZVdzV2w5WW1Ib0UxQ2N0dThnU0xF?oc=5\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#767469\">电子工程专辑</a> · 기사 제목 한 줄만 인용했습니다</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #A8792B;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin:26px 0;background:#FDF6E7\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:17px;color:#0D1725;margin-bottom:10px\">오늘 배운 것</div>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1p